    "short_description": "INK INSIDE is a CO-OP action RPG based on a lost cartoon pilot! Play as Stick (Brian David Gilbert) an unfinished doodle fighting back against the wet &quot;Sog&quot; corrupting the notebook they live in. Team up with a friend in CO-OP to find treasure, upgrade your characters, and beat-up the sog together!",
    "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Japanese<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
    "reviews": "\u201cInk Inside stays true to its RPG-like elements and does not disappoint...\u201d<br>9/10 \u2013 Comicbuzz<br><br>\u201cI highly recommend this game. The creator\u2019s love and passion show through in the ability to make playing the game feel nostalgic \u2014 like you\u2019re a kid curling up to watch your favorite cartoon.\u201d<br>Game Raven Review<br><br>\u201cThe game manages to combine light-hearted cartoon charm with real emotional stakes.\u201d<br>#1 upcoming game LA Comicon \u2013 Templeofgeek<br>",
